  "description": "CR 603.6a, 602.5d, 113.6m, 701.10e, 122.1a: Sage of the Fang's enters trigger puts a +1/+1 counter on target creature, an opponent's included; its renew, only as a sorcery and only from the graveyard, puts one on target creature, an opponent's included, and then doubles that creature's +1/+1 counters",
